<ContentPage title="About Konarkini" metaTitle="About Us | The Konarkini Story" description="Meet Konarkini, a thoughtful children's clothing brand creating soft, uncomplicated everyday wear for ages zero to five." path="/about/" eyebrow="Our story"><h2>Made for childhood as it really is</h2><p>We believe children's clothes should make room for children: for naps, first steps, floor-time, garden adventures, and all the beautiful in-between moments. That means comfortable shapes, gentle materials, and pieces that are simple to live in.</p><h2>Our point of view</h2><p>Konarkini is cute without the clutter. Our collections are designed around quiet colour, easy coordination, and honest product information—so families can choose with confidence.</p><div class="prose-cards"><div><h3>Comfort first</h3><p>Softness, movement, and practical care guide every piece.</p></div><div><h3>Thoughtful simplicity</h3><p>Useful details and versatile styles, without unnecessary fuss.</p></div><div><h3>Growing together</h3><p>Clothing for the extraordinary first five years.</p></div></div></ContentPage>
